name: MCP Gateway
on_save_actions:
  - sort_imports
  - format
style:
  python:
    max_line_length: 100
    quote_style: double
    trailing_commas: true
  markdown:
    wrap: 100
rules:
  - Prefer explicit function and variable names; avoid abbreviations.
  - Keep FastAPI route handlers thin; delegate to services.
  - Add docstrings to public functions and classes.
  - Avoid inline comments; explain intent above complex blocks.
  - Do not introduce blocking I/O in async routes; use httpx.AsyncClient.
  - Handle auth via dependency-based bearer token or session; no globals.
  - Keep Docker image small; use slim Python and multi-stage builds.
  - UI assets must be responsive and lightweight; no heavy frameworks by default.
  - Store secrets in environment variables; never commit secrets.
  - Write adapters with a common interface for sse, stdio, streamable-http.
